                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]\nApparently not that bad. Have some redeeming qualities like decent combo system and plenty of different attacks, dodges and such. Enemies are varied. Stages have plenty of platforming and battles and each stage ends with powerful boss. Clearly inspired by DMC and similar games. For beat'em up it's better than many mediocre games in this genre.\n[/h1]\n\nIf you have no sound, make sure to download OpenAL [url=https://www.openal.org/downloads/]HERE[/url]",
